{"Title":"An Act authorizing Cynthia Falzone to purchase creditable service from the Norfolk county retirement board","BillNumber":"H3979","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J23","Name":"Joint Committee on Public Service","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23","ResponseDate":"2023-07-10T12:27:43.72"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T17:08:56.9"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3979/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding chapter 32 of the General Laws or any other general or special law to the contrary, the Norfolk county retirement board shall credit Cynthia Falzone, a member of the Norfolk county retirement system, with 2.68 years of creditable service for school district employment, which includes work in Bristol county from 1997 to 2000 and Norfolk county during the 2002–2003 academic school year.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Eligibility for this creditable service shall be conditioned upon payment by Cynthia Falzone to the Norfolk county retirement system, in an amount equal to that which would have been withheld as regular deductions from her regular compensation for such previous service plus buyback interest, in one lump sum or installments, as the Norfolk county retirement board shall prescribe.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Redraft","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}